    {
      "number": 9,
      "id": "PR_kwDOUcQW4c8AAAABFunH1Q",
      "title": "update CODEOWNERS: all three authors, @usernames, current filename",
      "url": "https://github.com/szh/draft-agent-identity-metadata/pull/9",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "szh",
      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "The auto-generated CODEOWNERS was stale in three ways:\n\n- It referenced the pre-rename filename `draft-heigh-wimse-agent-identity-metadata.md` instead of the current one.\n- It listed only two authors by email (omitting @yaroslavros).\n- Email-based ownership is less reliable than GitHub usernames.\n\nThis replaces it with a single wildcard rule covering the whole repo:\n\n```\n* @szh @jsalowey @yaroslavros\n```\n\nThe generated header is removed so `make update-codeowners` does not silently overwrite the explicit author list on the next run.\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
